---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — Sokéfi">
  <main>
    <section class="pillar-header-card" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="pillar-header-media">
        <img
          src="/images/about-brand-plane.webp"
          alt="Guests boarding a small propeller plane on a sunlit airstrip under a clear blue sky."
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-header-text">
        <p class="pillar-eyebrow">Sokéfi</p>
        <h1 class="pillar-title" id="about-title">About Sokéfi</h1>
        <p class="pillar-tagline">It's a state of mind.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section pillar-intro" aria-label="About introduction">
      <div class="about-intro-grid">
        <div class="about-intro-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="about-main-copy">
          <p class="pillar-intro-text intro-p1">Welcome to Sokefi. We're so glad you found us.</p>
          <p class="pillar-intro-text intro-p2">
            What is Sokefi? Well, kefi is a Greek word describing that feeling of being completely
            alive. And being so kefi is what we're all about. Sokefi is a lifestyle destination for
            people in midlife and beyond who are living life fully — and loving it.
          </p>
          <p class="pillar-intro-text intro-p3">
            We started Sokefi because we looked around and didn't see ourselves. Not in the travel
            sites, not in the lifestyle magazines, not in the content that kept telling us what
            midlife was supposed to look like. We were living it!
          </p>
          <p class="pillar-intro-text intro-p4">
            This is for people who are finding — or rediscovering — their groove. The ones who know
            that being cool isn't about age or milestones.
          </p>
          <p class="pillar-intro-text intro-p5">
            It's for parents who are redefining themselves as empty nesters. It's for the couple
            rediscovering the joy of being together. It's for those embracing life on their own
            terms, maybe individually or perhaps as a couple. It's for the midlifer who is excited
            about what comes next.
          </p>
          <p class="pillar-intro-text intro-p6">
            Here you'll find travel — destination guides that go beyond the usual travel lists –
            designed for people who've been around enough to know what they're looking for. Honest
            conversation about the lifestyle and healthy living that go with this stage of life. And
            insights from people who are living it with you.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="about-pullquote">It's that feeling of being completely alive.</p>
        <p class="pillar-intro-text intro-p7 about-closing-line">
          This is midlife. Make it so kefi.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-kefi-band" aria-label="Sokefi visual sign-off">
      <div class="about-kefi-copy">
        <p class="about-kefi-title">SOKÉFI</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .pillar-intro {
    max-width: none;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    padding-top: clamp(0.4rem, 1vw, 0.8rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
  }

  .about-intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 700px) minmax(220px, 260px);
    column-gap: clamp(1.25rem, 3.2vw, 2.75rem);
    align-items: start;
    justify-content: start;
  }

  .about-intro-rule {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: #0c7fa2;
    margin: 0.35rem 0 1.3rem;
  }

  .about-main-copy {
    grid-column: 1;
  }

  .about-pullquote {
    grid-column: 2;
    margin: 9.5rem 0 0;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 260px;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.1vw, 1.62rem);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #c9a227;
    line-height: 1.6;
    word-break: normal;
    overflow-wrap: normal;
    hyphens: none;
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-pullquote::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.2rem;
    width: 2px;
    height: calc(100% - 0.4rem);
    background: #c9a227;
  }

  .pillar-intro-text {
    font-family: 'Source Serif Pro', serif;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #17272b;
  }

  .pillar-intro-text {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.45vw, 1.15rem);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-closing-line {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    justify-self: stretch;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1.5px solid #0c7fa2;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #17272b;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-kefi-band {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
    background: #1a5f6e;
    border-radius: 0;
  }

  .about-kefi-copy {
    position: relative;
    width: fit-content;
    padding-left: 1.35rem;
  }

  .about-kefi-copy::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.15rem;
    width: 2px;
    height: calc(100% - 0.3rem);
    background: #c9a227;
  }

  .about-kefi-title {
    margin: 0;
    color: #e0b739;
    text-align: left;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.35vw, 1.18rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .about-intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-main-copy {
      grid-column: 1;
    }

    .about-intro-rule {
      grid-column: 1;
    }

    .about-pullquote {
      grid-column: 1;
      width: min(100%, 520px);
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      text-align: center;
      padding-left: 0;
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    .about-pullquote::before {
      left: 50%;
      top: 0;
      width: 44px;
      height: 2px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
  }
</style>
